cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Carry-On in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Carry-On: a cooperative cross-platform continuation engine"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yedil
    given-names: Pauyedin
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ping-2o/carry-on"
url: "https://github.com/Ping-2o/carry-on"
abstract: >-
  A Rust engine that continues declared, typed actions across heterogeneous
  devices (macOS and Android): unsaved edits, view state and single-writer
  authority are carried with progressive, digest-verified transfer. Typed
  continuation, not process or memory migration.
keywords:
  - continuation
  - cross-device handoff
  - session transfer
  - single-writer authority
  - rust
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
